-------------------------------------------------------------------------

less-pager-mini is a reimplementation of less, whose behaviour and
control flow it follows deliberately.

less is distributed under either the GNU General Public License v3 or
the Less License, at the recipient's option (less's README). This
project takes the second: it is derived from less under the terms of
the Less License, NOT the GPL.

That license, and the copyright notice it requires be retained, are in
the file LESS-LICENSE, copied verbatim from less 710x - the version
this port is written against, named by LESS_VERSION in src/version.ts.
The notice to retain is the one carried by the source a work was taken
from, so LESS-LICENSE is re-copied when that version moves, not when
the calendar does:

    Less
    Copyright (C) 1984-2026  Mark Nudelman
